{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）上午11時25分，一輛貨櫃車沿屯門赤鱲角隧道公路，往屯門方向行駛，途至龍富路迴旋處時，懷疑失控撞向路邊石壆及撞毀一個路牌。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，發現57歲姓廖男司機被困車內，陷入昏迷。廖男其後由消防救出，並被送往屯門醫院搶救。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃車剷上路壆撞塌一個路牌。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182660646777393152819507.jpeg/41QyrOzigsPPWNeJmWp5307Km_A95B97SpqPdG-aj3Q\"/><figcaption>貨櫃車剷上路壆撞塌一個路牌。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃車剷上路中分隔石壆。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659529549025280124980.jpeg/1HUuP8x895JR1w6os8gMkU80n45mC-kHkkk1NbdJNTU\"/><figcaption>貨櫃車剷上路中分隔石壆。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一隻相信屬於事主的鞋。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182660912935342080792036.jpeg/90kvZV3BGEew29-GhjJ7ZAKu0Mlgr-QHY7UbF0a1Gxc\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一隻相信屬於事主的鞋。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659163616972800428679.jpeg/YbIvJ6YQx7dsmUVsak3bePvJqWzDADJ4Z9VPWkLVT1o\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659388599439360173568.jpeg/epBHMFLjT2bp7Sbxrhd_AzRBpygJ_psj5QbckcAG3JE\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在貨櫃車內調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261002/1182659169556369408627954.jpeg/RGpLpB61AKoyJRgD7i_wCROciiNMCpRkIejnSwTo50s\"/><figcaption>警員在貨櫃車內調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T12:40:25.330629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}